.120">that </span><span begin="01:27.120" end="01:27.480">I </span><span begin="01:27.480" end="01:28.080">can </span><span begin="01:28.080" end="01:28.800">hear </span><span begin="01:28.800" end="01:29.280">you </span><span begin="01:29.280" end="01:29.970">in </span><span begin="01:29.970" end="01:30.510">the </span><span begin="01:30.510" end="01:30.750">wind</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.910" end="01:42.540"><span begin="01:32.910" end="01:33.120">You're </span><span begin="01:33.120" end="01:34.080">singing </span><span begin="01:34.080" end="01:34.440">to </span><span begin="01:34.440" end="01:35.010">me </span><span begin="01:35.010" end="01:35.340">and </span><span begin="01:35.340" end="01:35.580"> </span><span begin="01:35.580" end="01:36.660">dancing </span><span begin="01:36.660" end="01:37.140">in </span><span begin="01:37.140" end="01:37.560">the </span><span begin="01:37.560" end="01:38.460">halls </span><span begin="01:38.460" end="01:39.660">outside </span><span begin="01:39.660" end="01:42.540">again</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.540" end="01:51.600"><span begin="01:42.540" end="01:42.900">I'm </span><span begin="01:42.900" end="01:44.010">always </span><span begin="01:44.010" end="01:45.870">listening</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.600" end="01:57.000"><span begin="01:51.600" end="01:52.110">Send </span><span begin="01:52.110" end="01:52.470">me </span><span begin="01:52.470" end="01:52.890">off </span><span begin="01:52.890" end="01:53.430">into </span><span begin="01:53.430" end="01:54.120">space </span><span begin="01:54.120" end="01:54.450">on </span><span begin="01:54.450" end="01:54.780">this </span><span begin="01:54.780" end="01:55.740">rocket </span><span begin="01:55.740" end="01:56.940">invention</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.000" end="01:59.430"><span begin="01:57.000" end="01:57.180">We'll </span><span begin="01:57.180" end="01:57.360">look </span><span begin="01:57.360" end="01:57.480">at </span><span begin="01:57.480" end="01:57.600">the </span><span begin="01:57.600" end="01:58.020">lights </span><span begin="01:58.020" end="01:58.230">over </span><span begin="01:58.230" end="01:58.470">the </span><span begin="01:58.470" end="01:59.370">atmosphere</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.430" end="02:01.170"><span begin="01:59.430" end="01:59.550">Eat </span><span begin="01:59.550" end="01:59.790">gold </span><span begin="01:59.790" end="02:00.030">medal </span><span begin="02:00.030" end="02:00.420">ribbon </span><span begin="02:00.420" end="02:00.600">till </span><span begin="02:00.600" end="02:00.720">we </span><span begin="02:00.720" end="02:01.170">die</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.170" end="02:11.010"><span begin="02:01.170" end="02:01.350">Up </span><span begin="02:01.350" end="02:01.710">here </span><span begin="02:01.710" end="02:01.860">it's </span><span begin="02:01.860" end="02:02.310">self</span><span begin="02:02.310" end="02:02.340">-</span><span begin="02:02.340" end="02:04.530">sabotage</span><span begin="02:04.530" end="02:04.680">, </span><span begin="02:04.680" end="02:08.640">suffocation</span><span begin="02:08.640" end="02:08.850">, </span><span begin="02:08.850" end="02:08.940">and </span><span begin="02:08.940" end="02:09.480">stale </span><span begin="02:09.480" end="02:10.110">taste </span><span begin="02:10.110" end="02:10.260">of </span><span begin="02:10.260" end="02:11.010">blood</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.010" end="02:18.300"><span begin="02:11.010" end="02:11.310">I </span><span begin="02:11.310" end="02:12.060">swear </span><span begin="02:12.060" end="02:12.480">that </span><span begin="02:12.480" end="02:12.840">I </span><span begin="02:12.840" end="02:13.440">can </span><span begin="02:13.440" end="02:13.470"> </span><span begin="02:13.470" end="02:14.190">hear </span><span begin="02:14.190" end="02:14.640">you </span><span begin="02:14.640" end="02:15.330">in </span><span begin="02:15.3